					10.225
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήδιστοι, οἱ</span>, <i>those nearest allied by marriage</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				8.583
			</span></i>.</div>
